<title>HUNGARY: BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
